WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.540
(soft music)

00:00:04.159 --> 00:00:04.971
- You eat my chicken all the time.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:05.633
- I am not.

00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:06.957
Yours looks better.

00:00:06.957 --> 00:00:08.698
(laughs)

00:00:08.698 --> 00:00:10.439
So, today's a special day.

00:00:10.439 --> 00:00:11.780
Got anything planned?

00:00:13.469 --> 00:00:14.851
- What day is it?

00:00:14.851 --> 00:00:16.070
- What month is it?

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.694
- Let me think.

00:00:17.694 --> 00:00:18.333
Think, Eli.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:19.215
- I think it's February.

00:00:19.215 --> 00:00:20.015
It's February.

00:00:20.015 --> 00:00:22.559
- Oh my god, it's Valentine's Day.

00:00:22.559 --> 00:00:24.644
- Oh, are you serious?

00:00:26.436 --> 00:00:28.433
- Okay, okay, what do we have planned?

00:00:28.433 --> 00:00:30.099
(sighs)

00:00:30.512 --> 00:00:31.416
- We got Chili's!

00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:33.060
(men cheer "Chili's" in unison)

00:00:33.657 --> 00:00:35.271
- Dinner and a movie.

00:00:35.271 --> 00:00:36.976
- That's it?

00:00:36.976 --> 00:00:38.371
- We got to up the romance.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.194
Up, up, up.

00:00:39.194 --> 00:00:39.774
- Okay, up the romance.

00:00:39.774 --> 00:00:40.391
Up the romance.

00:00:40.391 --> 00:00:42.133
What did we do last Valentine's Day?

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:43.676
- That was around the, the,

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.196
the Superbowl.

00:00:45.196 --> 00:00:47.274
- Yeah, oh man.

00:00:47.274 --> 00:00:48.587
- What a game.

00:00:48.587 --> 00:00:49.411
- We have to focus!

00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:52.157
- Oh, um...I got it.

00:00:52.475 --> 00:00:55.795
- Oh like, sip a little
bubbly, walk along the beach.

00:00:55.795 --> 00:00:56.998
You know.

00:00:58.269 --> 00:01:00.567
- What do you want from us, woman?

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:02.030
- I think it's time to go full romance.

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:04.352
(sirens blare)
- No, we haven't even recovered

00:01:04.352 --> 00:01:05.593
from our anniversary.

00:01:05.593 --> 00:01:06.324
- We can't.

00:01:06.324 --> 00:01:07.254
He'll be torn apart.

00:01:07.254 --> 00:01:08.839
- No, his body can take it.

00:01:09.853 --> 00:01:11.712
- He set the bar low for a reason.

00:01:11.712 --> 00:01:13.825
- He just got that raise.

00:01:13.825 --> 00:01:15.374
- That's it.

00:01:15.415 --> 00:01:17.000
We're going full romance!

00:01:17.145 --> 00:01:18.723
You know, I didn't want
to ruin the surprise,

00:01:18.723 --> 00:01:21.266
but, you know, rose petals.

00:01:21.266 --> 00:01:23.588
Put on that baby making mix.

00:01:23.588 --> 00:01:24.284
And feel up on that--

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:25.433
- Wait.

00:01:25.433 --> 00:01:26.931
Are you talking about your mom?

00:01:26.931 --> 00:01:29.590
You know she's coming
to town today, right?

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:31.446
(men sigh in relief)

00:01:31.446 --> 00:01:32.659
- Yeah.

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:34.849
- You thought it was Valentine's Day.

00:01:34.849 --> 00:01:36.392
- I knew my mom was coming to town.

00:01:36.392 --> 00:01:37.941
What are you talking about?

00:01:40.189 --> 00:01:41.129
- That was a close one.

00:01:41.129 --> 00:01:41.988
- Man.

00:01:41.988 --> 00:01:42.881
- Wait.

00:01:42.881 --> 00:01:45.104
What are we gonna do when Mom gets here?

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:46.992
- Chili's!

00:01:46.992 --> 00:01:48.960
- (cheer in unison) Chili's!

